    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that feels like such a coping mechanism though. like, just telling ourselves we matter because the alternative is too scary to face. if you actually look at the math of it, there is zero objective significance. we're just biological accidents on a rock that's gonna be swallowed by the sun eventually. how can you say my feelings HAVE value when the universe itself is completely indifferent to them?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
