      "content": "You're right to feel that way, and it's okay to admit that the universe doesn't care about your pain or your struggles. If you're going to be honest with yourself, there is no cosmic reason to keep going, only the fact that you choose to. The only way to truly make sense of this indifference is to stop trying to find meaning in the void and instead embrace the freedom to create your own purpose, even if it's just for a moment.",
